---
source: tests/cli_example_snaps.rs
expression: "&formatted_stdout"
---
Command:
govbot freshness

Output:
Corpus freshness — 2 jurisdiction(s)
  Action frontier: 2025-12-01  (newest legislative action in corpus)
  Ingest frontier: 2025-12-02  (most recent govbot ingestion in corpus)

CODE      BILLS  NEWEST ACTION  ACT_LAG  LAST INGEST  ING_LAG
wy           10     2025-12-01        0   2025-12-02        0
gu            5              -        -   2025-11-27        5

ACT_LAG = days the newest action trails the corpus action frontier.
ING_LAG = days the last govbot ingestion trails the corpus ingest frontier.
Large ACT_LAG with small ING_LAG => govbot is current; upstream is quiet
  (out of session or a stalled source). Large ING_LAG => govbot has not
  written new data for that jurisdiction — a likely ingestion-side stall.
